### Key Design Points:
- Hot path methods marked JSON_PARSER_INLINE for compiler optimization
- Manual union in JsonValue avoids virtual dispatch overhead
- ArenaAllocator uses exponential growth strategy (4KB → 8KB → ... → 1MB)
- All AST allocations go through ArenaAllocator::make<T>()
- StringView provides zero-copy string references into source buffer
- TokenStreamBuffer holds all tokens in contiguous arena-allocated array
- C++17 features: std::string_view, std::optional, constexpr, fold expressions

