### Design Notes:
- Hot path methods marked JSON_PARSER_INLINE for compiler optimization
- Manual union in JsonValue avoids virtual dispatch overhead
- ArenaAllocator uses exponential growth strategy (4KB → 8KB → ... → 1MB max)
- All AST allocations go through ArenaAllocator::make<T>() template
- StringView provides zero-copy string references into source buffer
- TokenStreamBuffer holds all tokens in contiguous array for cache-friendly iteration
- C++17 features used throughout (std::string_view, std::optional, constexpr, etc.)
- No exceptions by default (configurable via JSON_PARSER_USE_EXCEPTIONS)
- UTF-8 passthrough validation

